WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.159 --> 00:00:01.413
- I was a big Dairy Queen kid.

00:00:01.413 --> 00:00:03.294
- You're not a true Texan if
you haven't had Whataburger.

00:00:03.294 --> 00:00:05.360
- We are here, in one of the
greatest cities in the world,

00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:07.473
Austin, Texas, and my hometown,

00:00:07.473 --> 00:00:09.261
to try Whataburger.

00:00:09.261 --> 00:00:12.303
- Whataburger was started
in Corpus Christi in 1950,

00:00:12.303 --> 00:00:15.879
and since then it's dominated
the Texas fast food culture.

00:00:15.879 --> 00:00:17.202
- How often do you have Whataburger?

00:00:17.202 --> 00:00:19.002
- Every Saturday
- Every Saturday.

00:00:19.002 --> 00:00:20.372
- We've had our family Thanksgivings

00:00:20.372 --> 00:00:21.533
at Whataburger a couple times.

00:00:21.533 --> 00:00:24.389
- So we are here to see
what the fuss is all about.

00:00:28.989 --> 00:00:30.947
So I sent a message to
all my Facebook fans

00:00:30.947 --> 00:00:32.345
asking what I should get.

00:00:32.345 --> 00:00:34.090
Let's do two of the Patty Melts,

00:00:34.090 --> 00:00:35.835
Honey Butter Chicken Biscuit,

00:00:35.835 --> 00:00:37.194
let's do the Chicken Strips.

00:00:37.194 --> 00:00:38.553
- [Cashier] Two Jalapeno Cheeseburgers?

00:00:38.553 --> 00:00:39.912
- Yeah, and a bunch of ketchup.

00:00:39.912 --> 00:00:41.956
- That was just my order,
we have to get hers now.

00:00:41.956 --> 00:00:43.953
We just ordered $55 worth of food.

00:00:43.953 --> 00:00:45.911
Just by pure weight, Texas wins.

00:00:45.911 --> 00:00:47.273
- [Eugene] We should call Quinta.

00:00:47.273 --> 00:00:48.635
- Oh yeah.

00:00:48.635 --> 00:00:49.998
- You think she's had Whataburger before?

00:00:49.998 --> 00:00:50.593
- Probably not.

00:00:50.593 --> 00:00:52.389
- [Eugene] Have you ever
heard of Whataburger?

00:00:55.756 --> 00:00:57.482
- Unlike some of the other fast food

00:00:57.482 --> 00:00:59.688
restaurants, they never
made it till you ordered it.

00:00:59.688 --> 00:01:01.221
That's why we used to always eat here

00:01:01.221 --> 00:01:03.092
when I was little is
because it was always fresh.

00:01:05.853 --> 00:01:07.269
- [Ashly] The burgers are huge.

00:01:07.269 --> 00:01:09.209
- [Eugene] Wide and flat.
- [Ashly] Yeah, like Texas.

00:01:09.209 --> 00:01:10.498
(both laugh)

00:01:10.498 --> 00:01:12.518
- You have to hold this
with two hands, it's so big.

00:01:12.518 --> 00:01:13.795
- I love it, some people might describe

00:01:13.795 --> 00:01:16.512
it as buttery, some might
describe it as grilled.

00:01:16.512 --> 00:01:17.928
- The mustard is really weird,

00:01:17.928 --> 00:01:19.786
to bite into, unasked for.

00:01:19.786 --> 00:01:21.690
- This is way better than McDonald's.

00:01:21.690 --> 00:01:22.770
- Tastes like Burger King to me,

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:24.674
with like, jalapeno.
- This is the furthest away

00:01:24.674 --> 00:01:25.998
from a garden, and the closest

00:01:25.998 --> 00:01:27.112
you can get to a slaughterhouse.

00:01:27.112 --> 00:01:28.598
- I would give this one yee haw.

00:01:28.598 --> 00:01:30.131
There's no yee and haw about it.

00:01:30.131 --> 00:01:33.008
- If I had to compare this
to a Texas born celebrity,

00:01:33.008 --> 00:01:34.380
definitely Michelle Rodriguez.

00:01:34.380 --> 00:01:36.231
This is fast and it's furious,

00:01:36.231 --> 00:01:38.633
it'll probably exit me fast and furious.

00:01:38.633 --> 00:01:39.556
(laughs)

00:01:39.556 --> 00:01:41.321
- [Ashly] The Patty Melt

00:01:41.321 --> 00:01:43.887
- [Eugene] What? Damn that toast though.

00:01:43.887 --> 00:01:45.861
Ashly said that a lot
of her followers said

00:01:45.861 --> 00:01:47.625
that this was like one of the must haves.

00:01:47.625 --> 00:01:49.808
- I don't even like burgers,
and it tastes more home cooked,

00:01:49.808 --> 00:01:51.665
than any other fast food that I've had.

00:01:51.665 --> 00:01:53.105
- Anything on Texas toast.

00:01:53.105 --> 00:01:56.565
- And then just like a shit
ton of meat and it's so good.

00:01:56.565 --> 00:01:58.236
- I feel cheated.

00:01:58.236 --> 00:01:59.885
Because this is way
better than Dairy Queen.

00:01:59.885 --> 00:02:01.533
- I would give this three yee haws.

00:02:01.533 --> 00:02:02.625
- What celebrity is this?

00:02:02.625 --> 00:02:03.879
This is definitely Selena Gomez.

00:02:03.879 --> 00:02:06.224
This Patty Melt can get
it, just like Selena Gomez.

00:02:06.224 --> 00:02:08.289
- I've seen Eugene drunk, and the man

00:02:08.289 --> 00:02:10.344
can put away so much fast food.

00:02:11.925 --> 00:02:12.759
- What?

00:02:13.620 --> 00:02:14.804
Whatachick'n.

00:02:14.804 --> 00:02:16.256
- [Ashly] Whatachick'n,
why doesn't everything

00:02:16.256 --> 00:02:17.904
