00:02:23.314 --> 00:02:24.475
- I wouldn't kick this out of bed.

00:02:24.475 --> 00:02:27.331
- I give it two yee haws,
it's like perfectly acceptable

00:02:27.331 --> 00:02:28.585
but relatively bland.

00:02:28.585 --> 00:02:30.466
